# 1. Business State Machine

## States

- Draft Registration
- Pending Verification
- Documents Requested
- Verification Rejected
- Verified
- Suspended
- Reactivation Pending
- Deactivated

## Primary Flow

```
Draft Registration
        ↓
Pending Verification
        ↓
Documents Requested ←→ Pending Verification
        ↓
Verification Rejected → Pending Verification (resubmit)
        ↓
Verified ←→ Suspended → Reactivation Pending → Verified
        ↓
Deactivated
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Draft Registration | Pending Verification | Business |
| Pending Verification | Documents Requested | Admin |
| Pending Verification | Verified | Admin |
| Pending Verification | Verification Rejected | Admin |
| Documents Requested | Pending Verification | Business |
| Verification Rejected | Pending Verification | Business |
| Verified | Suspended | Admin |
| Suspended | Reactivation Pending | Business / Admin |
| Reactivation Pending | Verified | Admin |
| Reactivation Pending | Suspended | Admin |
| Verified / Suspended | Deactivated | Admin |

## Forbidden Transitions

- Draft Registration → Verified (skip review)
- Verification Rejected → Verified (without resubmission/review)
- Suspended → Verified without admin reactivation decision
- Any state → Draft Registration
- Self-approval by business into Verified

## Timeout Transitions

- Pending Verification aged beyond SLA → system flag/reminder (status may remain Pending Verification)
- Reactivation Pending aged beyond SLA → admin escalation flag

## Side Effects

- Entering Verified enables trading capabilities.
- Entering Suspended blocks new trade.
- Deactivated revokes operational access; history retained.

