# 3. User State Machine

## States

- Invited
- Active
- Suspended
- Removed

## Flow

```
Invited → Active ←→ Suspended → Removed
           ↓
        Removed
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Invited | Active | Invited User (+ system validation) |
| Active | Suspended | Owner/Manager/Admin |
| Suspended | Active | Owner/Manager/Admin |
| Active | Removed | Owner/Manager/Admin |
| Suspended | Removed | Owner/Manager/Admin |
| Invited | Removed | Owner/Manager/Admin (revoke invite) |

## Forbidden

- Removed → Active without new invite/rehire process
- User suspending themselves as sole owner without transfer
- Active → Invited

## Timeout

- Invited expires after invite TTL → Removed/Expired invite (terminal for that invite)

## Side Effects

- Suspended/Removed revoke access immediately.
- Attribution on historical records remains.

