# 5. Product State Machine

## States

- Draft
- Active
- Inactive
- Out of Stock
- Discontinued

## Flow

```
Draft → Active ←→ Inactive
          ↓
     Out of Stock ←→ Active
          ↓
     Discontinued
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Draft | Active | Stockist |
| Active | Inactive | Stockist |
| Inactive | Active | Stockist |
| Active | Out of Stock | System / Stockist |
| Out of Stock | Active | System / Stockist |
| Active/Inactive/Out of Stock | Discontinued | Stockist |
| Draft | Discontinued | Stockist |

## Forbidden

- Discontinued → Active without controlled reactivation policy
- Pharmacy changing stockist product state
- Active → Draft

## System Transitions

- Available sellable qty = 0 → Out of Stock
- Sellable qty > 0 and product sellable → Active (from Out of Stock)

