# 6. Batch State Machine

## States

- Active
- Quarantined
- Recalled
- Expired
- Consumed / Closed

## Flow

```
Active → Quarantined → Active (release)
   ↓
Recalled
   ↓
Expired
   ↓
Consumed / Closed
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Active | Quarantined | Business |
| Quarantined | Active | Business (if safe) |
| Active/Quarantined | Recalled | Business / Admin |
| Active | Expired | System (date) |
| Any non-closed | Consumed / Closed | System when qty 0 and closed |

## Forbidden

- Expired → Active
- Recalled → Active without formal clearance policy
- Allocate sellable fulfilment from Expired/Recalled/Quarantined

## Timeout / System

- At expiry date boundary → Expired automatically

