# 7. Inventory Availability States (Derived)

## States

- Available
- Reserved
- Low Stock
- Zero
- Expired
- Quarantined

These are primarily derived from quantities + batch state.

## System Transitions

- On Hand − Reserved > 0 → Available
- Reserved > 0 → Reserved presence
- On Hand = 0 → Zero
- On Hand > 0 and ≤ reorder level → Low Stock
- Batch Expired/Quarantined dominates sellability

No manual jump that bypasses movements is allowed.

