# 8. Order State Machine

## States

- Draft
- Pending
- Accepted
- Rejected
- Cancelled
- Packed
- Dispatched
- Partially Delivered
- Delivered
- Closed

## Primary Flow

```
Draft
  ↓
Pending
  ↓
Accepted / Rejected / Cancelled
  ↓
Packed
  ↓
Dispatched
  ↓
Partially Delivered → Delivered
  ↓
Closed
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Draft | Pending | Pharmacy |
| Draft | Cancelled | Pharmacy (discard/cancel draft) |
| Pending | Accepted | Stockist |
| Pending | Rejected | Stockist |
| Pending | Cancelled | Pharmacy (if allowed) / Stockist (if allowed) |
| Accepted | Packed | Stockist |
| Accepted | Cancelled | Stockist/Pharmacy per rules |
| Packed | Dispatched | Stockist |
| Packed | Cancelled | Stockist before dispatch if allowed |
| Dispatched | Partially Delivered | Delivery / Stockist / Pharmacy receipt |
| Dispatched | Delivered | Delivery / Stockist / Pharmacy receipt |
| Partially Delivered | Delivered | Delivery completion of remainder |
| Partially Delivered | Cancelled (remainder) | Controlled remainder cancel |
| Delivered | Closed | System / authorised user when closure rules met |
| Rejected | Closed | System |
| Cancelled | Closed | System |

## Forbidden Transitions

- Draft → Accepted
- Pending → Delivered
- Rejected → Accepted
- Rejected → Packed
- Cancelled → Dispatched
- Delivered → Pending
- Closed → any operational state
- Pharmacy: Pending → Accepted
- Order skip from Accepted → Delivered without dispatch/delivery records (unless explicitly future-authorised)

## Recovery Transitions

- Dispatched → Failed delivery handling does not return Order to Accepted silently; uses delivery failure path and then retry dispatch or controlled cancel/return-to-stock path
- Partially Delivered → Dispatched (retry remaining) if multi-trip allowed

## Timeout Transitions

- Pending aged beyond SLA → reminder to stockist; optional auto-reject/cancel if policy enabled
- Draft aged beyond TTL → auto-cancel/discard

## Side Effects

- Pending: notify stockist
- Accepted: optional inventory reservation
- Rejected/Cancelled: release reservation
- Packed: fulfilment lock on lines begins
- Dispatched: delivery entity active
- Delivered: return eligibility may begin
- Closed: no further operational mutation except audit-safe financial follow-ups already linked

