# 9. Delivery State Machine

## States

- Pending Assignment
- Assigned
- Out for Delivery
- Partially Delivered
- Delivered
- Failed
- Cancelled
- Returned to Stockist

## Flow

```
Pending Assignment → Assigned → Out for Delivery
                                    ↓
                     Partially Delivered / Delivered / Failed
                                    ↓
                            Returned to Stockist
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Pending Assignment | Assigned | Stockist |
| Assigned | Out for Delivery | Stockist / Delivery Boy |
| Assigned | Cancelled | Stockist |
| Out for Delivery | Delivered | Delivery Boy / Stockist / Pharmacy confirm |
| Out for Delivery | Partially Delivered | Delivery Boy / Stockist |
| Out for Delivery | Failed | Delivery Boy / Stockist |
| Failed | Assigned | Stockist (retry) |
| Failed | Returned to Stockist | Stockist / Delivery Boy |
| Partially Delivered | Out for Delivery | Stockist (remaining trip) |
| Partially Delivered | Delivered | Completion of remainder |

## Forbidden

- Pending Assignment → Delivered
- Delivered → Out for Delivery
- Cancelled → Delivered
- Failed → Delivered without a new successful delivery attempt record

## Side Effects

- Delivered updates Order toward Delivered/Partially Delivered
- Failed prevents false completion
- Returned to Stockist may release goods back to inventory per rules

