# 10. Invoice State Machine

## States

- Draft
- Issued
- Partially Paid
- Paid
- Overdue
- Void
- Locked

## Flow

```
Draft → Issued → Partially Paid → Paid → Locked
           ↓
        Overdue → Partially Paid / Paid
           ↓
          Void (controlled)
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Draft | Issued | Stockist |
| Draft | Void/Discard | Stockist |
| Issued | Partially Paid | System on approved payment/credit |
| Issued | Paid | System when outstanding = 0 |
| Issued | Overdue | System on due date |
| Issued | Void | Stockist/Admin controlled |
| Partially Paid | Paid | System |
| Partially Paid | Overdue | System |
| Overdue | Partially Paid | System |
| Overdue | Paid | System |
| Paid | Locked | System / policy |
| Partially Paid | Void | Forbidden generally |

## Forbidden

- Paid → Issued
- Void → Paid
- Pharmacy editing Issued totals
- Issued → Draft
- Delete transition

## Timeout

- Issued/Partially Paid past due date → Overdue

## Side Effects

- Issued creates outstanding liability
- Paid/Partially Paid recalculated from payments + credits
- Void requires reason and no improper settlement residue

