# 11. Payment State Machine

## States

- Draft
- Submitted
- Under Review
- Approved
- Rejected
- On Hold
- Cancelled

## Flow

```
Draft → Submitted → Under Review → Approved
                        ↓    ↓
                   Rejected  On Hold ←→ Under Review
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Draft | Submitted | Pharmacy |
| Draft | Cancelled | Pharmacy |
| Submitted | Under Review | Stockist / System |
| Under Review | Approved | Stockist |
| Under Review | Rejected | Stockist |
| Under Review | On Hold | Stockist |
| On Hold | Under Review | Stockist |
| On Hold | Approved | Stockist |
| On Hold | Rejected | Stockist |
| Submitted | Cancelled | Pharmacy before review lock |

## Forbidden

- Pharmacy → Approved
- Approved → Rejected silent reversal without controlled reversal policy
- Rejected → Approved without new payment
- Approved → Draft

## Side Effects

- Approved allocates settlement and reduces invoice outstanding
- Rejected/Cancelled have no settlement effect
- On Hold pauses settlement

## Timeout

- Submitted/Under Review aged → reminder to stockist

