# 12. Return State Machine

## States

- Draft
- Submitted
- Under Review
- Approved
- Partially Approved
- Rejected
- Goods Received Back
- Closed

## Flow

```
Draft → Submitted → Under Review → Approved / Partially Approved / Rejected
                                      ↓
                             Goods Received Back
                                      ↓
                                   Closed
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Draft | Submitted | Pharmacy |
| Draft | Cancelled/Discard | Pharmacy |
| Submitted | Under Review | Stockist / System |
| Under Review | Approved | Stockist |
| Under Review | Partially Approved | Stockist |
| Under Review | Rejected | Stockist |
| Approved / Partially Approved | Goods Received Back | Stockist (if physical return required) |
| Approved / Partially Approved | Closed | Stockist/System if no goods return needed |
| Goods Received Back | Closed | Stockist / System |
| Rejected | Closed | System |

## Forbidden

- Pharmacy → Approved
- Rejected → Approved
- Submitted from undelivered goods
- Closed → Under Review without formal reopen policy

## Side Effects

- Approved enables credit note issuance
- Goods Received Back may create inventory movements by disposition
- Rejected creates no credit

