# 13. Credit Note State Machine

## States

- Draft
- Issued
- Partially Applied
- Fully Applied
- Void
- Expired

## Flow

```
Draft → Issued → Partially Applied → Fully Applied
           ↓
         Void
           ↓
        Expired
```

## Allowed Transitions

| From | To | Actor |
|---|---|---|
| Draft | Issued | Stockist |
| Draft | Discard | Stockist |
| Issued | Partially Applied | System/authorised apply |
| Issued | Fully Applied | System/authorised apply |
| Partially Applied | Fully Applied | System |
| Issued (unapplied) | Void | Stockist/Admin controlled |
| Issued / Partially Applied | Expired | System if credit expiry policy exists |

## Forbidden

- Fully Applied → Void
- Pharmacy issuing credit
- Issued amount increased after issue
- Negative remaining

## Side Effects

- Application reduces invoice outstanding and credit remaining
- Void only when application rules allow clean reversal/non-use

